# TrustAsia TLS RSA Root CA (TrustAsia Technologies, Inc.), trusted only by the T-Bank acquiring client (billing, #389) next to the Russian Trusted Root CA.
# Why: T-Bank «Установка TLS-сертификатов» (https://developer.tbank.ru/eacq/intro/certificates/, read 2026-10-09) requires both roots during the transition;
# pay.tbank-online.com already chains LiteSSL RSA CA 2025 -> TrustAsia TLS RSA Root CA. Source: https://repository.trustasia.com/repo/certs/dedicated/TrustAsiaTLSRSARootCA.cer
